          "index": 3,
          "start": 11.64,
          "end": 19.36,
          "relative_start": 11.64,
          "relative_end": 19.36,
          "en": "So listen, I'm more concerned about, you know, last month, you know, people were, you know, tremendously excited about a big jobs number.",
