          "en_highlights": [
            "last month",
            "big jobs number"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "start": 19.36,
          "end": 24.56,
          "relative_start": 19.36,
          "relative_end": 24.56,
          "en": "But if you actually broke it down last month, you have 50, I think it's 54,000 jobs in state and local.",
          "zh": "但如果仔细分析，上个月有5.4万个岗位来自州和地方政府。",
