          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "54,000 jobs",
            "state and local"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 5,
          "start": 24.56,
          "end": 32.6,
          "relative_start": 24.56,
          "relative_end": 32.6,
          "en": "We didn't really get anything this month. And then you had this huge bump in restaurants in bars, and then obviously that came off significantly.",
          "zh": "这个月没什么新增，而餐馆和酒吧的就业曾大幅增长，现在明显回落。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "餐馆和酒吧",
            "明显回落"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "restaurants in bars",
            "came off significantly"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 6,
          "start": 32.6,
          "end": 36.16,
          "relative_start": 32.6,
          "relative_end": 36.16,
          "en": "Although I'm surprised it actually came off that much this month.",
          "zh": "不过这个月回落幅度之大让我意外。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "回落幅度之大"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "came off that much"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 7,
          "start": 36.16,
          "end": 42.32,
          "relative_start": 36.16,
          "relative_end": 42.32,
          "en": "I thought it would have taken another month or two for that to come off. But listen, I think the hiring in the country is just OK.",
          "zh": "我本以为还会再持续一两个月。但总体而言，美国招聘情况只是还行。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "招聘情况只是还行"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "hiring in the country is just OK"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 8,
          "start": 42.32,
          "end": 45.56,
          "relative_start": 42.32,
          "relative_end": 45.56,
          "en": "I mean, I think it is, I think Mike McKee said it right.",
          "zh": "我认为Mike McKee说得对。",
          "zh_highlights": [
            "Mike McKee说得对"
          ],
          "en_highlights": [
            "Mike McKee said it right"
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 9,
          "start": 45.56,
          "end": 51.08,
          "relative_start": 45.56,
          "relative_end": 51.08,
          "en": "It's stable, it's OK, but you've got an economy that's growing at some pretty significant numbers.",
          "zh": "就业市场稳定、尚可，但经济增长相当强劲。",
          "zh_highlights": [
