          "index": 10,
          "start": 51.08,
          "end": 55.96,
          "relative_start": 51.08,
          "relative_end": 55.96,
          "en": "And the employment picture is just OK. I just don't think we are hiring that many people.",
          "zh": "而就业情况只是还行，我不认为我们在大量招聘。",
